OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fclearer spells in the west this
OL,7,Fevening, but generally a cloudy night
OL,8,Fwith patchy light rain developing
OL,9,Fthrough the early hours. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA largely cloudy day with
OL,12,Foutbreaks of mainly light rain and
OL,13,Fdrizzle slowly dying out. Winds
OL,14,Fremaining light.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLittle
OL,17,Fchange, often cloudy through into next
OL,18,Fweek, mostly dry but with patchy
OL,19,Fdrizzle possible at times. Where any
OL,20,Fcloud breaks occur overnight fog and
OL,21,Ffrost may develop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
